  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to the Solid Waste Management Crisis in the Gaza strip</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to urgently address the solid waste crisis and restore solid waste management services in the Gaza Strip is of paramount importance. It represents a critical component of the ongoing humanitarian response, as well as a prerequisite for early recovery and for internally displaced people to return to their homes and rebuild their lives and livelihoods as soon as the security conditions on the ground allow so. The project was designed to enhance the operational capacities of the so</narrative>
  </description>
